step The Charred Vale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip South-west of Sun Rock lies the burned Charred Vale. Plant the Gaea Seeds in the dirt mounds on the valley floor; the fire elementals drop Incendrites. Bloodfury Harpies and Ambushers nest on the north side, Slayers and Roguefeathers to the south.
  collect 16312 quest 6393
  collect 277936 quest 86576.1        -- Glittering Sunstone, from any Bloodfury harpy
  kill 4022 quest 6282.1
